{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4fa2a4161098dd02ca36b574487c857770bff78a0424925ee8ecbd1497feecfb", "ja": "紗代子、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装、着てみた感じはどうだ？", "zh": "纱代子，辛苦了。\n穿上新服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "1c6a9d913c52c29e67513568abfd40cc5a282a233c75dc0f3d22d17f27a62d16", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nサイズはばっちりです！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n尺寸正合适！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "dc321e2d13a773dfce6050b7b653c0c14dcd71b07332a3efaabc514c225775e1", "ja": "確かこの衣装って、豊穣の女神を\nイメージしたものなんですよね？", "zh": "这套服装，好像是以丰收女神为原型设计的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "61429fe4f05a20f8bd2f0a9e3e236600ea7e08fc42ef987b49b2a22213a06ab5", "ja": "なんだか照れちゃいますけど……立派な女神らしく\nなれるよう、いろいろ頑張ってみますね！", "zh": "虽然总觉得有点害羞……不过，为了成为一名出色的女神，我会努力尝试各种事情的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7e0368d990d7e6143a7c06bc0a7cee7266128803ac236439447089dec8f063fc", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな！\nでも、女神らしくって……何を頑張るつもりなんだ？", "zh": "哦，真可靠啊！\n不过，所谓“像女神一样”……你打算在哪些方面努力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "0d11cf3c24519ebcacd30e9afbc73ee61dce95758942ec6a6cbde849e601f52d", "ja": "はい、女神ですから、みんなの支えっていうか……\n応援できたらって思うんです。", "zh": "是的，因为我是女神嘛，也就是说……我想为大家提供支持，或者说……要是能给大家加油就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "8607c253fd872b6d163684e0ee167d56d4dbf0ff89b967a400b3c904076286dd", "ja": "なにしろ豊穣の女神ですから、みんな、たくさん\n食べて、元気に頑張ろう！みたいな感じで♪", "zh": "毕竟是丰饶女神嘛，所以就是希望大家多吃一点，打起精神加油吧！这样的感觉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1007_se", "source_sha256": "15b27d53743e4d370888938f57c9b3b17f7d4240078a8ded542634d337718059", "ja": "ぐううぅぅ……", "zh": "呜呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "d430c5eaa0287dd43da4711396370f94a914bc14a0fdd921c56facae33537bc7", "ja": "あ…………。", "zh": "啊…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "cc119c9b638f0c704e00b28184a939ec4c6b5619c176a30e7c8deac911c07783", "ja": "ち、違うんです！　これはその、\n最近ダンスレッスンを頑張っているせいなだけで！", "zh": "不、不是这样的！只是因为最近一直努力练习舞蹈，所以才会这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "a7f19cb813f7282ab4a015bdc4b5b0c658412f8af78a00833ef2322a40ebfd26", "ja": "せっかく新しい衣装をもらったんだし、\n似合うようにならなきゃと思って、それで……。", "zh": "难得拿到了新衣服，我想着一定要变得适合穿它才行，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1b8eca8443ea91ff5c78f90d367c0d018dbaf0156ce9f60bdb19e237893f6ed4", "ja": "いや、何も言ってないけど……\nつまり、ダイエットしてるのか？", "zh": "不是，我什么都没说……\n也就是说，你在减肥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "e7a42c08da9bb7b09324699741f5c77e34a40b49fe763911a5a8921622926dc7", "ja": "は、はい……。女神として、\nスタイルを崩すわけには……。", "zh": "是、是的……作为女神，不能让身材走样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e509db9157ae9b189c7e63ab4c8e4b2415c1c342a13cd8afed17b5d83ef563f9", "ja": "気をつけるのはいいけど……でも豊穣の女神が\nお腹を空かせてたら、みんなもガッカリするぞ？", "zh": "注意一点是没错……可是，丰收女神要是饿着肚子，大家也会失望的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dd0955a60150fd744e5fe5b5fad85f196141be3275cfc4f059ae6913c6286526", "ja": "豊穣の女神らしく、でも紗代子らしく。たくさん\n食べて、たくさん応援したらいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "要像丰收女神一样，但也要像纱代子一样。多吃点，多给大家加油，不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "896d8faf6d8623c9df977f693611454c2cffeb0d5cabaa20db88c68ecb98c3df", "ja": "たくさん食べて、たくさん応援……そ、そうですね。\n応援でたくさん動けば、大丈夫……大丈夫！", "zh": "吃很多，再多多加油……对、对啊。\n只要在加油时多动一动，就没问题……没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "24fafe5dcaf0b1f60fc88bede2d43632de0fac66ac131b81d26a32cb58e5033c", "ja": "そうそう。それに心配しなくても、\n紗代子はスタイルいいんだし。大丈夫、大丈夫！", "zh": "对对。而且你也不用担心，  \n纱代子的身材很好嘛。没问题，没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "a942456be128fef12ffadfc7a219d0c907d94b76af5d5788ea4d4c0b1e62914a", "ja": "えっ。そ、そんな、{$P$}……。\nうう～～～っ、やっぱりダメです！", "zh": "诶。没、没有啦，{$P$}……。\n呜呜～～～，果然还是不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1018_p", "source_sha256": "44cc830a443e9880625176b1d13724a36fe7baab7bb1d236279c3f8c183188cd", "ja": "えっ？　ダメって、どうして……。", "zh": "诶？说不行，为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "71f5da276b3f2eab4f6972ffbfaf78d7670ed9226d37a4066fcca86ed595471c", "ja": "褒められちゃうと私、ますます意識して……！\nああっ、昨日もたい焼き食べちゃったのに！", "zh": "被夸了之后，我就会更加在意这件事……！啊啊，可是我昨天明明还吃了鲷鱼烧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "dab92bf35717ce80107a00182c3401cdec67f6084b0ff27320ed84da90eec6cf", "ja": "私、走り込み行ってきます！\nすみません、探さないでください～～～！！", "zh": "我去跑步训练了！\n对不起，请不要来找我～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0144_1021_p", "source_sha256": "896c708f45693205c13fabd367933950d81adf6f3dada0700475c04ece442904", "ja": "って、その格好じゃ探すって！　おーい、紗代子ー！", "zh": "喂，穿成这样怎么可能不找啊！喂——紗代子——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
